{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nWe arrived in Koblenz this evening, the heat finally broken by the river. The journey from Kassel was an exercise in endurance. I was forced to sit facing backward, opposite a Göttingen student who clung to the rear seat with a tenacity that bordered on the absurd. The other passengers were a motley crew; one Englishman abandoned us at the last moment, leaving us with the full weight of six souls in a cramped interior.\n\nI confess I found the backward view of the Lahn’s banks strangely comforting, a constant reminder that progress often requires looking at what has just passed. The river followed the coach faithfully, a mirror to our own restless movement. I am tired, but the wine here is good. I think of you and the boys in Berlin, where the air is still. Do not worry; I am merely traversing, not arriving.\n\nYours,\nG.W.F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795080169,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":197,"prompt_tokens":941,"total_tokens":1138,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-ja4A1VhES7Y5wzp0io0bD9w6OlAzlmUn","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":941,"prompt_ms":1010.311,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.0736567481402763,"prompt_per_second":931.3963720082232,"predicted_n":197,"predicted_ms":4790.953,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.443637755102042,"predicted_per_second":40.910440991593944}}